[statement]
A POSIX header ending in star's trailer, `tar` and a NUL, whose prefix is 131
bytes, the length of star's prefix field. Every reader joins the whole
prefix to the name, and so does ferrotape.

[archive]
header name=f prefix="p"*131 @508="tar\x00"
data "hello\n"
end

[verdict]
all: read

